cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Wave_Analysis, please cite it using the metadata below. Cite upstream data providers separately (docs/CITATION_POLICY.md)."
type: software
title: "Wave_Analysis: a reproducible framework for multimodal ocean-wave data and vision-based wave-state estimation"
abstract: >-
  Research software for acquiring, cataloguing, synchronising, quality-controlling
  (IOOS QARTOD), and modelling heterogeneous ocean-wave datasets, including NOAA NDBC
  bulk and directional spectral wave data, buoy-camera imagery, and leakage-aware
  machine-learning dataset construction and evaluation.
authors:
  - family-names: "Cohen"
    given-names: "Steven"
    affiliation: "Florida Atlantic University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/StevenFAU/Wave_Analysis"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0.dev0"
keywords:
  - oceanography
  - ocean waves
  - significant wave height
  - wave spectra
  - computer vision
  - NDBC
  - QARTOD
  - reproducibility
